{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_148_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "0cfb55c058441408c1776395e79ebe424dd5dda57a5525a51f3ba04ce4a8f70d", "ja": "沖縄のにーにーから\n荷物が届いたんだ。\nお菓子もあるからみんなで食べて！", "zh": "冲绳的哥哥寄来了包裹。\n里面还有点心，大家一起吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_148_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b033586e18ef67c8ec8a9f93b13b1bf32a4a444ed6a4fd7558475399b230e24", "ja": "わ、トウガラシ味噌！\nこれ焼肉につけると\n美味しいんだよね！", "zh": "哇，是辣椒味噌！\n这个蘸烤肉吃，\n很好吃的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_148_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "3596294a76cfa69c678f38e627c04218503f1e49c3b92415fba4d4c4c1fc4aaa", "ja": "この、黒いの……お砂糖？", "zh": "这个黑乎乎的……是砂糖？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_148_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "3dbd9199d135b60b42ff29ed1e4fe9a0a577d4918c73933c52ea035afb6f887c", "ja": "さとうきびから作った黒砂糖さー。\n料理に使ってもいいし、\nそのまま食べても美味しいんだぞ！", "zh": "这是用甘蔗制成的黑糖啦——\n拿来做菜也可以，\n直接吃也很好吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_148_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "065058ce22662ff737c3723e2d562ae0edbbbda0eab5da5f0983312657db3943", "ja": "みんな絶対喜ぶよ！　うちの\n兄貴なんて何もくれないけど。\n響はお兄さんと仲いいんだ？", "zh": "大家绝对会很高兴的！我家老哥\n可什么都不给我呢。\n响跟你哥哥关系很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_148_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "a38bad6be25176e31f1c6928f7e90bd7cee20d294820005515ca0622a78c0ca9", "ja": "え、そうでもないぞ？\n憎まれ口ばっかりだし……。\nでも、まあ、家族だからねっ。", "zh": "诶，也没那么好啦？\n他净说些招人嫌的话……\n不过，毕竟是家人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
